member.param:
Story 4.4 recovery signal, a real tri-state:
true — a drain is armed and the platform will retry publication automatically;
false — terminal, no further automatic attempt will be made (attempts exhausted,
dead-lettered, or no reminder armed);
null — a legacy record written before this field existed. null never means
"permanently failed".

