Gets the original end-user actor identifier, sourced from the sub claim and
distinct from any authenticated workload acting on their behalf. Optional; 
for legacy single-principal callers.

Returns  when the supplied metadata satisfies every validation rule
for safe serialization (length bounds, ASCII printable, no forbidden secret-shaped fields,
no unknown future version).
